WEBVTT

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:18.000
My role is serving corporate clients every single day

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.000
I have to finish by this Wednesday no delay

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:26.000
The meeting is on Friday so the pressure's getting high

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.000
It's such a demanding job I gotta sit and sigh

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
It's very boring so I'll quit and find a brand new space

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:38.000
I'm searching for something to escape this relentless pace

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:42.000
I'm finding that it's getting old and I am truly scared

00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.000
He's gonna be a manager but I am unprepared

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:50.000
Gotta give it a try! Gotta give it a try!

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:54.000
I'm gonna break these heavy chains and fly!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
I get to choose my very own way today!

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.000
I've got nothing left to lose so don't you make me stay!

00:01:16.000 --> 00:01:20.000
I'm freelance now which means that I am completely free

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000
I could be called to any job just you wait and see

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.000
What that means is I write my own rules every single day

00:01:28.000 --> 00:01:32.000
No more working with those corporate fools who stand in my way

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:50.000
I've worked for this firm almost my whole career it's true

00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:54.000
It's been a bit stressful with too many things to do

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:58.000
But I'm ready for a change the time to act is finally here

00:01:58.000 --> 00:02:04.000
You should do what you want and conquer every single fear

00:02:18.000 --> 00:02:22.000
Gotta give it a try! Gotta give it a try!

00:02:22.000 --> 00:02:28.000
I'm gotta go, I'm finding that I'm finally free!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:34.000
Yeah! This is my life now!